  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dialogue@Work</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening an inclusive, constructive social dialogue on socio-economic policies at national and decentralised levels
Improved labour rights and a living wage for workers in supply chains. 
Greater employability of young people
More equality in employment rights and salary, and more power in the workplace for women</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Unions and workers</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">increasing inclusive economic development and a fairer distribution of work and income.</narrative>
  </description>
